{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_moeshd_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_moeshd_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "生意場",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_moeshd_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ad16718fe61236e37c35b77a99af63135a813319e2db5b2c4301731375b63b41",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "能天使，可頌有回你消息嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "嗯，她說可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "雖然她說過公司爆倉的話我們可以先把貨物存放在這裡，但還是說一下為好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "唉，這個購物節大促銷活動搞得公司倉庫裡面堆得滿滿當當，連個下腳的地方都騰不出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "是啊，好久都沒有這樣忙碌過了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "沒想到可頌的房間看起來普普通通，底下卻有這麼大一間倉庫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "她和我提過這件事。說自己租了兩層樓，一層住人，一層用來放東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "這麼多貨物，她都分門別類放得整整齊齊，一眼望過去讓人心情都變得舒暢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "水果罐頭的話，我看看......工藝品、日用品、服飾、食物，應該是放在這裡吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "嗯......旁邊這一摞箱子是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "美施保養油......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "能天使姐，我一接到你的消息就回來了！怎麼樣，你們找到存放的地方了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "找到是找到了......我剛剛看到了很多保養油堆在那裡，怎麼，你這麼快就把貨買到手了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "你還有剩的錢嗎？不是上個月才管我借了一筆錢購入布料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那是之前囤積的舊版啦。我打算將這些庫存轉手賣出去，這樣就有資金可以購入新款了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "會有人願意買這些過時的產品嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "雖然是今年年初的舊款，但還在保存期限內，價格又比市面上的新款低，應該會有人願意接手吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "年初？這家公司產品更新速度也太快了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一年推出兩個全新的版本，研發實力應該很雄厚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "可頌......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎麼了，空？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "如果唱片公司一年內要我出兩張唱片，我一定很難保證品質。但是隔行如隔山，我也不好說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "安心啦，這家保養油我也一直在用，品質很不錯的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車載廣播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "機器出現銹蝕！設備磨損老化！附件運動乾滯！你是不是束手無策？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車載廣播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒關係，新款美施保養油來幫你，耐高溫，耐氧化，高黏度，低雜質，是你最好的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車載廣播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "新添加獨特成分，讓你的機械設備時刻保持光潔如新，五種功效，開啟你的全新使用體驗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車載廣播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在訂購整套，更有隱藏款等你發現。永遠，選擇美施，永遠，熱愛生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "可頌，我們能把廣播關了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "美施為了做廣告真是下了血本，真是每時每刻都逃不過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車載廣播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "美施現推出和龍門著名匠人李錘錘聯名的限量款保養油，網店門店均有銷售。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車載廣播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "前一百位訂購者將獲得我們贈送的李錘錘同款簽名機修工具套餐，請速速撥打我們的訂購熱線吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "低沉的男聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我是李錘錘，美施，大師的品質之選。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？這不是那位影片網站上很火的機修大師嗎？想不到他居然會選擇和美施聯名推出保養油產品，看來新款產品在他那裡很受青睞啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "最重要的難道不是用戶的口碑嗎？一個大師也說明不了什麼吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "排隊購買這款產品的人真的非常多，從街頭一直排到街尾，火爆程度簡直遠超我的想像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這種不愁銷路的貨物怎麼想都得囤一點啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "是，它是不愁銷路，可你的舊庫存呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉，別提了，來找我的商家像是說好了一樣，都出了很低的價格，應該是吃準了我急用錢要在短時間內出手，所以才敢壓價到這麼低吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "那你怎麼想，要不要賣給他們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這周內如果沒有其他人聯繫我的話，也只能這樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "做生意難免有虧損的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸，你是安慰我嗎？能天使姐~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "咳，看前面不要看我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車載廣播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "香氛產品清倉大拍賣，買不了吃虧買不了上當，種種香型一應俱全，統統跳樓價，有意者請撥打xxxxxxxx，鼻尖芬芳，等待您的聯絡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈，看起來還有一個可憐的傢伙和我一樣為倉庫裡的存貨而發愁啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "你的笑容看起來非常勉強啊，可頌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車載廣播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "燕麥奶配咖啡，讓你的生活更健康，更美好。有時候，一加一，不只是二。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "呃，現在的廣告越來越煩，越來越離譜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......可我覺得很有道理啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "燕麥奶配咖啡讓你的生活更美好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不是，是他說的最後一句話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "一加一，不只是二？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小姐，請稍等下，鼻尖芬芳的負責人就在裡面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "張先生，有一位小姐早上預約了和您會面，請問您現在有空嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "請她進來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小姐，請進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "張先生您好，冒昧來訪我很抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈，沒關係，小姐，該怎麼稱呼你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可頌，叫我可頌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可頌小姐，請問你今天造訪是為了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，是這樣的，我有一批舊版美施保養油亟待出售，但是積壓在倉庫裡很難找到合適的買家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我想你誤會了，本公司並不需要保養油，如你所見，我們自己的產品也積壓在倉庫裡難以銷售。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（伸出手指晃晃）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不不不，我並不是來推銷自己的貨物的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......那你是來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我是來尋求和您合作的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "雖然我很心動，但實話說，我不覺得你像是有什麼厲害的銷售管道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "張先生您的眼光很準啊，不過我提供的不是管道，而是策略。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦，策略？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是的，一種可以讓我們雙方共贏的策略。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "捆綁銷售你我的庫存商品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "過時的保養油和過時的香氛產品，感覺這是一個註定會被消費者摒棄的組合啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我庫存的保養油氣味有些刺鼻，配合香氛產品使用，剛剛好可以優化使用體驗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而且我注意到您的香氛產品有著眾多的香型，這就是關鍵所在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "雖然保養油加香氛的組合單一，但是因為貴公司產品香型繁多，所以簡單的組合有著很多不一樣的搭配方案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "包裝還可以不寫明香型，讓客戶隨機購買，增加趣味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（贊許地點頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "麻煩問下，張先生，貴公司的產品有沒有哪一款是相對受歡迎的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "玫瑰香型賣得最好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那贈品就是它了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "銷量最好的東西做贈品，這不符合常理吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎麼會，獲得贈品的條件可是集齊其他幾種香型組合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦——但是玫瑰香型庫存較少，到時候要是不夠贈送怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咳，那就只好把它作為獎品了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "每集齊一套香型組合，便贈送一次抽獎機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我懂了，我這邊有些零零碎碎的東西可以作為感謝獎，二等獎和三等獎可以分別送保養油和香氛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這一等獎嘛，讓我再想想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉，一等獎我可以提供，雖然很心痛，但是為了生意，我願意割愛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是大帝先生的簽名海報。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真的嗎？！這是可以送的東西？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗚......沒錯，是我收藏了很久的寶貝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（耶，去年壓箱底的最佳員工獎終於派上用場了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可頌小姐，聽到你這一番話，我茅塞頓開，可是這後續的利潤分成怎麼算？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我想我司的香氛產品會在銷售中占大頭，理應拿多一份吧，你看......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在談這個為時尚早啦，張先生，我們還是先制訂更詳細的銷售方案吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好好好，這是我的名片，你隨時聯繫我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "張先生，作為交換，這是我的名片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎麼啦，張先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒事，就是從來沒見過這麼......可愛的名片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈，讓人印象深刻嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "你終於回來了，談得怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "非常好，但是最後如何分成還沒有談攏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "你打算怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......或許，我現在可以給他打個電話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "電話號碼是多少來著，讓我看看名片夾，服裝店、電器店、農產品店、理髮店......啊，鼻尖芬芳，在這裡，找到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "......你這名片夾攤開來都拖地了，不是，你這時候打給他是已經有詳細方案了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "詳細方案？現在談這個為時尚早啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您好，請問是張先生嗎？早上我剛剛聯繫過您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是的，沒錯，我是可頌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我這邊的貨物已經清點完畢了，隨時可以送去進行包裝，不過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不過剛剛有位機修店的採購負責人找到了我，她似乎對我的保養油很感興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃......是這樣的，她出了理想的價格，希望我能將這批保養油轉手賣給她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒有，我還沒有答應，我當然是希望能和貴司這樣規模更大的企業合作，但是嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯，我清楚，但生意場上這些都是難免的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "糟了，張先生，她追過來了，您稍等下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "（這傢伙的演技也太純熟了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（虛按話筒）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什麼？！女士您真的要買全部嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎呀，這樣真的不好，我都答應和別人的商品捆綁銷售了。哎呀，這不是出不出更高價的問題呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這實在是太為難我了。急用也......不太合適吧......好吧好吧，我會考慮的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（鬆開話筒）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "張先生，讓您久等了，真是太不好意思了，剛剛那位採購負責人一直纏著我不放，他們好像接了一個很大的項目，需要很多保養油。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您剛剛是說要提高我這邊的利潤分成嗎？哎呀，這怎麼好意思呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "很感謝您願意讓步，那真是太好了，謝謝您！明天早上您有空繼續談談嗎？那好，明天見了，張先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "談妥了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "對，沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "算一算到時候不僅有資金進購新貨，給空的還款也不成問題，真是萬幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "可頌，你有考慮過去演藝圈發展事業嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不划算，不考慮。等等......你不會是認真的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "（聳肩）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘿......簡直是意想不到的順利啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（看著玻璃上映出的自己）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘖，你不賺錢誰賺錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘿咻！這是今天賣掉的最後一箱了，數數看......還剩兩箱，不錯，這次還沒有售罄就已經賺回本了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "之前我並不理解你囤貨的決定，現在看來確實很有道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這可是我從小被爹地媽咪訓練出來的獨到眼光，超級無敵準確，非常可靠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "經商世家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......算是吧，我從小長在爹地媽咪的小店，耳濡目染，多多少少是沾染了他們的想法與習慣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "那剩下的保養油你找好買家了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這兩箱我打算留下自用，感覺客戶的用後回饋都不錯，是品質上乘的好東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "可以給我一瓶嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "給你一箱都沒問題，隨便拿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "（仔細查看包裝）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎，你在看什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "配方，我得看看銃械能不能使用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "對哦，之前一直忙著賣貨，也沒仔細研究下新款保養油裡面到底添加了什麼東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "之前的空瓶子還沒有扔，可以拿過來對比著看一看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我拿回來了！你來看看......他們到底加了什麼厲害的成分？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "先是百分之七十五的礦物基礎油。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒變啊......添加劑呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "有黏度改進劑、抗氧化劑、抗腐蝕劑......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘶，也沒啥變化啊。什麼嘛，配料都是一模一樣的，廣告裡說的新成分呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "等等，好像後面確實有一種新加的材料......玫瑰醚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這是什麼東西？等我搜索一下......玫瑰醚，香味物質，有著玫瑰的清新香氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "所以，所謂的新款保養油就只是多添加了一種香精嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎麼......感覺被擺了一道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "說明你和商家的想法不謀而合啊，好事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "（拍拍可頌的肩膀）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "走吧，晚上還有訂單需要派送。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "可頌，你不走嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一個月後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "這地方怎麼老在排長隊，過了街角都看不到頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "估計又是什麼新品的發售日吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "螢幕上的廣告",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "全新美施保養油首日上市，個性化定製服務，彰顯自我，十二種香型搭配，提升體驗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "螢幕上的廣告",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在訂購，更有與專業香氛品牌鼻尖芬芳合作推出的神秘香型贈送。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "螢幕上的廣告",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "永遠，選擇美施，永遠，熱愛生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "這家店的保養油不是上個月才出了新款嗎？怎麼這麼快就推陳出新了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "你猜，隊伍裡面有沒有可頌在排？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "雖然猜她在，是再合理不過的事情。但是嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "我猜她不在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "可頌之前一直很失落呢，約她去購物街不去，美食街也不去，連自己的生意都懶得打理了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "你不知道，她的小倉庫裡面已經變得空蕩蕩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "看來她的確因為那件事深受打擊啊，想來也是，忙到頭發現自己被商家牽著鼻子走，怎麼想都很沮喪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "那傢伙不會從此就放棄自己的生意了吧......？說起來好幾天都沒有見過她了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "唉，我也不知道，但我有點想念原來那個風風火火的她了，是盈是虧，第二天都能活力滿滿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "我也是啊......不過，鼻尖芬芳這個牌子怎麼這麼熟悉啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "哎，能天使，你看，我猜對了，可頌沒在隊伍裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "晚上好啊，諸位，結束了一天的工作，要不要來一份最新口味的脆骨肉丸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "謝謝啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你倆要回去嗎？上車吧，順路捎你們一程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "（側過身子）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "嗯咳，你有發現什麼新東西嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你......換新髮型了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "不是我啊，是我後面的櫥窗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦——原來是那個啊，嘿，我一周前就知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "這不是今天剛推出的產品嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是美施的內部消息，我幫他們介紹了不錯的合作方，就是那位張先生。為了答謝，他們提前給我開通了新款的特惠購買管道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "怪不得我覺得這個名字這麼耳熟......你已經囤好新款貨物了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒有，我拒絕了他們的特惠管道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "為什麼？這可是一個賺得盆滿缽滿的好機會啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我不打算摻和這些了，我已經有了全新的銷售計畫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "你打算賣什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "哇，可頌，這個脆骨肉丸也太好吃了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
